  <data name="CliHelp" xml:space="preserve"><value>Kumquat: local file converter.

Usage:
  kumquat-cli convert &lt;file&gt;... --to &lt;format&gt; [--out &lt;folder&gt;]
  kumquat-cli targets &lt;file&gt;...        formats the file can be converted to
  kumquat-cli tools &lt;file&gt;...          tools available for the file
  kumquat-cli apply &lt;tool&gt; &lt;file&gt;... [--set key=value]...
  kumquat-cli formats                  known formats
  kumquat-cli engines                  engine status

Examples:
  kumquat-cli convert photo.heic --to jpg
  kumquat-cli convert *.wav --to mp3 --out D:\music
  kumquat-cli apply media.trim video.mp4 --set start=0:10 --set end=0:45
  kumquat-cli apply office.metadata report.docx --set creator="Mary Smith"</value></data>
